      "generator.direction / distribution.direction / sourceGenerator.direction / inputPoints.direction: type is 'enum' but getDropdownNiceName returns '' on gridDistribution (icon-button UI, e.g. Flow Columns/Flow Rows). Same attrId returns real labels ('Horizontal'/'Vertical') on linearDistribution. Confirmed manually: 0=Flow Columns, 1=Flow Rows for Grid.",
      "horizontalAlignment index 3 (textShape) returns '' — likely 'Justify', not confirmed.",
      "masks.N.mode (mask boolean combine type) is type 'int', not 'enum' — no labels available via API at all. Confirmed manually by toggling in the UI: 0=Union, 1=Subtract, 2=Intersect (default), 3=Exclude (not directly confirmed, by elimination).",
      "Array/compound sub-paths (e.g. masks.0.mode) do not exist via getAttributes()/hasAttribute() until at least one array element exists (api.addArrayIndex first)."
